                <pb facs="0616" n="482" xml:id="pg482"/>

                <head>No. 334.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Anderson to Mr. Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Copenhagen</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-01-08"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 8,
                        1888</date>.<lb/>(Received January 9—11.10 a.m.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Benson’s identity perfectly established. Prisoner will be delivered to United
                    States officer on his arrival here. Send officer at once.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Anderson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
